# ========================================
# SECURITY & EMAIL CONFIGURATION
# ========================================

# Email Configuration for Form Submissions
# This email account will be used to send form notifications

# Gmail account that will send the emails
EMAIL_USER=your-gmail-account@gmail.com

# Gmail App Password (not your regular password)
# To generate an app password:
# 1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Enable 2-factor authentication if not already enabled
# 3. Search for "App passwords"
# 4. Generate a new app password for "Mail"
# 5. Copy the 16-character password here (without spaces)
EMAIL_PASSWORD=your-app-password-here

# All form submissions will be sent to:
# Rgvbuildingsolutions@gmail.com (configured in app/api/lead/route.ts)

# ========================================
# SECURITY FEATURES IMPLEMENTED
# ========================================
# 1. Rate Limiting: 3 submissions per minute, 10 per hour per IP
# 2. Input Sanitization: All HTML/Scripts removed from inputs
# 3. Honeypot Field: Hidden field to detect bots
# 4. Email Validation: Blocks disposable emails
# 5. Phone Validation: Validates format and patterns
# 6. Suspicious Pattern Detection: Blocks spam content
# 7. CSRF Protection: Optional token validation
# 8. Secure Email: Uses TLS/SSL for email transmission
# 9. Privacy Protection: IP addresses are partially logged
# 10. XSS Prevention: All user input is sanitized